---
// 首页 Hero 横幅：背景图 + 渐变遮罩 + 欢迎文案
---

<div class="hero-banner">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/page-bg.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <p class="hero-hello">✦ HELLO, FRIENDS</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">欢迎来到<br />我的小小宇宙</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">这里记录代码、生活，<br />和一些溜达途中看到的事。</p>
    <p class="hero-sign">—— 落羽闲笺</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .hero-banner {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 240px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    animation: fadeInUp 0.5s ease-out both;
  }

  .hero-img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      100deg,
      rgba(var(--bg-rgb), 0.94) 0%,
      rgba(var(--bg-rgb), 0.75) 38%,
      rgba(var(--bg-rgb), 0.1) 70%
    );
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 2rem 2.2rem;
    max-width: 55%;
  }

  .hero-hello {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    color: var(--accent-hover);
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .hero-sign {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }


  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-banner {
      min-height: 200px;
    }
    .hero-content {
      max-width: 80%;
      padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
  }
</style>
